Package: MRPRecalculation
Title: Additive MRP Recalculation
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Florian", "Schmidt", , "florian.schmidt@imise.uni-leipzig.de", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Recalculates retrospective MRPs for a selected time range,
    persists only newly identified rows, and exports the results to REDCap.
